#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Appointments 📅</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>预约 📅</strong>"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Appointments</strong> – Let customers book grooming services online "
"with predefined services and\n"
"                availability."
msgstr ""
"<strong>预约</strong> – 让客户在线预约美容服务，服务项目与可预约时段均可预"
"设。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:pet_groomer.appointment_type_grooming_service
msgid ""
"<strong>Bath &amp; Dry</strong> – wash with pet-safe shampoos, conditioners, "
"blow-dry."
msgstr "<strong>洗浴与吹干</strong> – 使用宠物安全洗发水、护毛素清洗并吹干。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:pet_groomer.appointment_type_grooming_service
msgid ""
"<strong>Brushing &amp; De-shedding</strong> – remove loose fur, undercoat, "
"reduce shedding."
msgstr "<strong>梳理与去浮毛</strong> – 去除浮毛、底绒，减少掉毛。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Calendar 🗓️</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>日历 🗓️</strong>"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Calendar</strong> – Visualize and manage grooming sessions, staff "
"schedules, and availability in one\n"
"                place."
msgstr ""
"<strong>日历</strong> – 在一处可视化并管理美容服务、员工排班和可预约时段。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:pet_groomer.appointment_type_animal_wellness
msgid ""
"<strong>Coat Conditioning Treatments</strong> – special shampoos, oils, or "
"masks."
msgstr "<strong>被毛调理护理</strong> – 特殊洗发水、精油或护毛面膜。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:pet_groomer.appointment_type_animal_wellness
msgid ""
"<strong>Creative Grooming</strong> – coat dyeing, fur sculpting, accessories "
"(bows, bandanas)."
msgstr "<strong>创意美容</strong> – 被毛染色、毛发雕塑、配饰（蝴蝶结、方巾）。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:pet_groomer.appointment_type_animal_wellness
msgid ""
"<strong>De-matting</strong> – untangling severe knots in long-haired breeds."
msgstr "<strong>解结</strong> – 解开长毛品种的严重毛结。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>HR Apps </strong>- Manage employees, recruitment, and time off using "
"Odoo’s HR suite."
msgstr ""
"<strong>人力资源应用 </strong>- 使用 Odoo 的人力资源套件管理员工、招聘和休"
"假。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:pet_groomer.appointment_type_grooming_service
msgid ""
"<strong>Haircuts &amp; Styling</strong> – breed-standard trims (poodles, "
"terriers) or custom owner requests."
msgstr ""
"<strong>修剪与造型</strong> – 按品种标准的修剪（贵宾犬、梗犬）或按主人自定义"
"要求。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>How it’s used in a grooming business:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>在美容企业中的用法：</strong>"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Inventory</strong> – Track grooming products, retail items, and "
"stock levels in real time."
msgstr "<strong>库存</strong> – 实时跟踪美容产品、零售商品和库存水平。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Odoo for Pet Groomers</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Odoo 宠物美容行业方案</strong>"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Pets 🐾</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>宠物 🐾</strong>"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Pets</strong> – Store detailed profiles for each pet, including "
"breed, size, notes, and grooming\n"
"                history."
msgstr ""
"<strong>宠物</strong> – 为每只宠物保存详细档案，包括品种、体型、备注和美容历"
"史。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Planning</strong> – Organize employee shifts, workload distribution, "
"and time-off."
msgstr "<strong>排班</strong> – 组织员工班次、工作量分配和休假。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Point of Sale 🧾</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>销售点 🧾</strong>"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Point of Sale</strong> – Quickly charge grooming services and retail "
"products at the counter."
msgstr "<strong>销售点</strong> – 在柜台快速为美容服务和零售产品收费。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:pet_groomer.appointment_type_grooming_service
msgid ""
"<strong>Puppy’s First Groom</strong> – gentle introduction session for young "
"dogs."
msgstr "<strong>幼犬首次美容</strong> – 为幼犬提供温和的初次体验。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Purchase &amp; Inventory 📦</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>采购与库存 📦</strong>"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Sales 💼</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>销售 💼</strong>"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Sales</strong> – Create service orders, manage pricing, and prepare "
"transactions before payment."
msgstr "<strong>销售</strong> – 创建服务订单、管理定价，并在收款前准备好交易。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:pet_groomer.appointment_type_animal_wellness
msgid ""
"<strong>Seasonal Packages</strong> – “Summer cut” or “Winter coat "
"maintenance.”"
msgstr "<strong>季节性套餐</strong> – “夏季剪裁”或“冬季被毛护理”。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Sign</strong> – Digitally manage consent forms, liability waivers, "
"and service approvals."
msgstr "<strong>签署</strong> – 数字化管理同意书、责任豁免和服务确认。"

#. module: pet_groomer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pet_groomer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Survey</strong> - Track client satisfaction &amp; feedback using "
"Odoo Survey"
msgstr "<strong>调查</strong> - 使用 Odoo 调查跟踪客户满意度与反馈"

